    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1083-a3">

                <pb facs="0990" n="676" xml:id="pg676"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commanding Officer of the Charleston Navy Yard</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Helm</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of the Navy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Yard</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Charleston</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring Secretary of Navy’s telegram August 21, shall radio apparatus merchant
                    vessel belligerent powers in this port be sealed by naval representatives?
                    Request instructions.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Helm</hi>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
